    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WMC201 · Chapter 5 · Session 20</span>\n<h2>Session 20 — In-Class Activities</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14145 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WMC201 · Chương 5 · Buổi 20</span>\n<h2>Buổi 20 — In-Class Activities</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14145 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO3, CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO3, CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>In-Class Activities<br>- Writing News Stories: Students will practice writing concise, fact-based news articles using journalistic structure and style in English, while also learning the basic Vietnamese format for print news writing.<br>- Writing Feature Stories: Students will develop longer-form, human-interest stories using narrative techniques, character development, and thematic depth in English, while also learning the basic Vietnamese format for feature writing.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Core and supplementary reading materials, along with any additional resources recommended by the lecturer.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Participate in Q&amp;A sessions, discussions, and other learning activities as guided by the lecturer.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
