    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WMC201 · Assessment 3/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Assignment (At Home)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14145 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WMC201 · Đầu điểm 3/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Assignment (At Home)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14145 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">- Individual Assignment 2 (In class) Write a press release that aligns with the course Learning Outcomes (LOs).</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Demonstrate the ability to produce content across a variety of forms and genres in diverse news settings.<br><br>Utilize AI tools to edit a news release for the individual at-home assignment, as permitted by the course guidelines.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">1. Individual Assignment 1 – Writing<br>Write a News Story or Feature Story (at home)<br>Grading Criteria (Maximum: 10 Points)<br>The following criteria will be used to evaluate submitted work:<br>- Good lead, clear foreshadow and nut graf, good arrangment of information. (2 points)<br>- Good choice of information to put on top. (1 point)<br>- Good choice of new angle of the story (1 point)<br>- Present good news values from the story (1 point)<br>- Effectively use quotations (1.5)<br>- Use suitable photos/images with captions.(1 point)<br>- Well explain AI usage in this feaure story<br>(Students must submit a 150–200 word paragraph explaining how AI tools were used to generate ideas or enhance clarity and quality. A screenshot demonstrating AI usage is required) (1.5 points)<br>- Grammar, spelling (1 point)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Students are required to complete two individual assignments as part of the course assessment:<br>In-Class Assignment (Weight: 15%): Designed to strengthen writing skills and provide practical preparation for the final exam.<br>At-Home Assignment (Weight: 10%): Completed independently outside of class.<br>Assignment Flexibility: Lecturers may modify the assignment formats as appropriate to align with the course’s illustrated Learning Outcomes (LOs) and to best support student learning and progression.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 31 — Phase 1 of Group Assignment: Brainstorm idea/script for the TV news (this phase will be implemented in class under the supervision of the l…</li><li>Session 32 — Phase 1 of Group Assignment: Brainstorm idea/script for the TV news (this phase will be implemented in class under the supervision of the l…</li><li>Session 33 — Phase 1 of Group Assignment: Brainstorm idea/script for the TV news (this phase will be implemented in class under the supervision of the l…</li><li>Session 55 — Individual Assignment (in-class)</li><li>Session 56 — Individual Assignment (in-class)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 31 — Phase 1 of Group Assignment: Brainstorm idea/script for the TV news (this phase will be implemented in class under the supervision of the l…</li><li>Buổi 32 — Phase 1 of Group Assignment: Brainstorm idea/script for the TV news (this phase will be implemented in class under the supervision of the l…</li><li>Buổi 33 — Phase 1 of Group Assignment: Brainstorm idea/script for the TV news (this phase will be implemented in class under the supervision of the l…</li><li>Buổi 55 — Individual Assignment (in-class)</li><li>Buổi 56 — Individual Assignment (in-class)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
